        "text": "As of tomorrow I will have brought 71 of my large clients to @Grok @Bot at their corporations. It has not failed to revolutionize each department across a wide spectrum of companies.\n\nNext week I hold a symposium for executives to map out the future.\n\nThis is the most important AI tool released thus far.",
