      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "The @SpaceX Dragon is counting down to its launch at 6:33 a.m. EDT today to resupply the Expedition 75 crew with over 6,300 pounds of science, supplies, and roll-out solar arrays. https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1DGleVQZqOdJL",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
