      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Grok Bot fixed a customer's bug while I was out with my family. My app user emailed me about an error. My Grok Bot handled it from A to Z. Found bugs, fixed them, and shipped on its own. So many use cases with Grok Bot. \nJust try it.",
