      "text": "Grok @Bot memory transfer",
      "quote": {
        "author": "BrianRoemmele",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1492616506/Brian-Med-Green-Fin_200x200.png",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-13 11:46:21",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-13T03:46:21.000Z",
        "id": "2109853221808435364",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Brian Roemmele",
        "text": "NEW GROK BOT!\n\nAI MEMORY TRANSFER!\n\nYour old AI knows you. \n\nYour new one shouldn't have to start from zero. 🧠➡️\n\nMeet Memory Transfer, a @Grok @Bot that brings over what Claude or ChatGPT learned about you, so you don't spend weeks re-explaining yourself.\n\nThere are two ways to bring it over:\n\n• Paste one prompt into your old chat and send me the answer.\n\n• Or drop in your full ChatGPT or Claude data export.\n\nThe part that matters most is that nothing gets in automatically. \n\nWe review every item together, one line at a time. Only what you keep gets saved, and each item is tagged with where it came from and when. \n\nOther AIs' guesses don't become facts, and nothing you've already saved gets overwritten unless you say so.\n\nSwitch assistants and keep your context, without the junk.\n\nTry Memory Transfer on Grok Bot today. \n\nhttps://x.ai/bot/Ww-RXj-lLqpg_oWqzccKZ",
        "url": "https://x.com/BrianRoemmele/status/2109853221808435364",
